# `buildtools/rewrite/bin/` -> bin/
# `buildtools/rewrite/obj/` -> obj/
# `src/obj/` -> obj/
# `refs-v0/`, `refs-v4/`, `refs/` -> These are directories full of DLLs. 
# If I add `*.dll`, it covers everything. But `bin/` and `obj/` cover the build tools.
# Let's stick to standard .NET ignores first.

